This works for me.

gi <- gl2gi(gl)
strata(gi) <- read.table(stratafile, header = T)
setPop(gi) <- ~STRATA
gl <- gi2gl(gi)

gl <- gl.compliance.check(gl)
gl <- gl.recalc.metrics(gl)

gl@other$loc.metrics.flags
  array(NA, 1) AvgPIC OneRatioRef OneRatioSnp PICRef PICSnp CallRate FreqHomRef FreqHomSnp FreqHets monomorphs  maf OneRatio   PIC

1           NA   TRUE        TRUE        TRUE   TRUE   TRUE     TRUE       TRUE       TRUE     TRUE       TRUE TRUE    FALSE FALSE

It would be good to have a script without having to go into genind object.

Many thanks,
Sun

